  "claim": "Queued messages did not work like Claude Code: a message sent while the agent worked waited for the whole turn to end and then ran as a separate turn, and Stop kept the queue instead of giving the text back to edit. In Claude Code the agent reads a queued message at its next step in the same turn, and Esc returns queued messages to the input.",
